{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the award-winning Politaire, Apple\u2019s Game of the Year 2016, comes a new evolution of Solitaire-Poker roguelite.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742960/extras/f6aa2ad31d6b49ff4b13a97c43e1ec1b.poster.avif?t=1772785194\" width=800 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742960/extras/f6aa2ad31d6b49ff4b13a97c43e1ec1b.webm?t=1772785194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hardcore Solitaire\u2013Poker roguelite. The game challenges you not only to break every rule with expert deck\u2011building, but also to master sublime card\u2011stacking skills to unleash limitless, thrilling combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742960/extras/bb439e93b41b2997f6124479ffeb41cd.poster.avif?t=1772785194\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742960/extras/bb439e93b41b2997f6124479ffeb41cd.webm?t=1772785194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742960/extras/bb439e93b41b2997f6124479ffeb41cd.mp4?t=1772785194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine powerful heroes and unique abilities to face ever-changing battles against formidable bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your card-stacking strategy to unleash devastating combos and maximize your army\u2019s potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn coins through victories, then unlock new heroes, hidden powers, and training systems as you push beyond every limit of the game. Breaking rules, breaking balance, and breaking through satisfaction.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742960/extras/995f893991d6a770023c9836dc8e5c35.poster.avif?t=1772785194\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742960/extras/995f893991d6a770023c9836dc8e5c35.webm?t=1772785194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Solitaire\u2013Poker Gameplay: A mind-bending fusion of Solitaire and Poker that rewards strategy, foresight, and pure combo mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Hero Building: Build your team from a roster of heroes, each with unique skills and synergies. Combine abilities to create wild, unpredictable setups that break every rule on the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training System &amp; Hidden Powers: Merge and inherit hero abilities to evolve your strategy beyond limits. Unlock secret skills and game-breaking upgrades that push your play style to new extremes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-Changing Boss Battles: No two encounters are the same. Each boss brings new abilities and tactics, forcing you to adapt, read the battlefield, and perfect your card-stacking mastery to claim victory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossor